  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Thinking and Working Political - better programme outcomes through political analysis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funds to support the Thinking and Working Politically Community of Practice Secretariat.  A stronger adoption of Thinking and Working Politically approaches is essential to efforts to support democracy governance and improve impacts of democratic programming (and other FCDO governance and sector programming).  This project also provides invaluable direct strategic support to FCDO complementing the Centre of Expertise and providing a further unique route to support Posts</narrative>
  </description>
